{
  "_comment": "SMOKE ONLY — verifies SCCL v7 (Branch E, E1) wiring on the real engine with 2 families x 4 tasks. Four learners: 'sccl' (NOT in sccl_capprobe_learners -> checked_cap=0, no cap_rates = isolation control), 'sccl_capprobe_strat' (K=1, theta=0 -> legacy any-pass path: cap stratum engaged but NO cap_rates/cap_retain_min/cap_n on any gate record = bit-identity shape control), 'sccl_strict' (K=1, theta=1.0, n=3 -> every gate with checked_cap>0 must log cap_rates with n in {3,5} and cap_retain_min=1.0), 'sccl_ens_strict_anchor' (K=3, theta=1.0, n=3, anchor lambda=0.1 -> cap_rates engaged AND anchor_pen>0 on accepted updates). Confirms the v7 fail-closed engagement evidence (C2 cap_rates engagement, C3 dose sanity, C4 isolation, anchor on) before the full ladder. Never used for results.",
